{"seq":6,"slug":"longevity-medicine","title":"长寿医学","stage":"DONE","category":"health-medicine","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/longevity-medicine","rating":{"composite":3.71,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.54,"verdict":"consider","uScore":3.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"长寿医学\">长寿医学</h1><p>长寿医学（Longevity Medicine）是一门融合老年病学、分子生物学、表观遗传学和个体化医学的前沿交叉学科。其核心目标不仅是延长人类寿命（lifespan），更在于延长健康寿命（healthspan）——即在保持良好身体与认知功能状态下的存活年数。</p>\n<p>随着全球人口老龄化加速（预计2050年60岁以上人口将达20亿），衰老相关慢性疾病的医疗负担急剧增长。传统医学逐一攻克心脏病、癌症、神经退行性疾病的策略已显局限；老年科学（geroscience）提出了全新范式——通过干预衰老的共享生物学机制，同时延缓多种年龄相关疾病的发生。</p>\n<p>本 Hub 从四个维度系统梳理长寿医学的核心知识体系：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章节</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>关键内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>衰老生物学</td>\n<td>衰老的分子与细胞机制</td>\n<td>端粒缩短、线粒体功能障碍、表观遗传时钟、衰老标志物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>干预策略</td>\n<td>药理与非药理干预手段</td>\n<td>热量限制模拟物、Senolytics、运动抗衰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生物标志物与监测</td>\n<td>衰老评估与追踪</td>\n<td>生物年龄评估、血液标志物、可穿戴设备监测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长寿生活方式</td>\n<td>循证生活方式实践</td>\n<td>蓝区经验、睡眠/压力/社交、个人策略设计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>学习本 Hub 后，你将建立对衰老机制的系统理解，掌握当前最前沿的抗衰老干预证据，并能为自己设计科学的长寿策略。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"aging-biology","title":"衰老生物学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/longevity-medicine/aging-biology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cellular-senescence-mechanisms","title":"细胞衰老机制：端粒、线粒体与衰老信号通路","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/longevity-medicine/aging-biology/cellular-senescence-mechanisms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"epigenetic-clocks","title":"表观遗传时钟：DNA甲基化与生物年龄测量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/longevity-medicine/aging-biology/epigenetic-clocks"},{"seq":3,"slug":"hallmarks-of-aging","title":"衰老标志物：十二大Hallmarks全景解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/longevity-medicine/aging-biology/hallmarks-of-aging"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"intervention-strategies","title":"干预策略","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/longevity-medicine/intervention-strategies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"caloric-restriction-mimetics","title":"热量限制与模拟物：雷帕霉素、二甲双胍和NAD⁺前体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/longevity-medicine/intervention-strategies/caloric-restriction-mimetics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"senolytics-therapy","title":"Senolytics疗法：靶向清除衰老细胞","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/longevity-medicine/intervention-strategies/senolytics-therapy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"exercise-and-anti-aging","title":"运动与抗衰老：多通路协同的最强干预","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/longevity-medicine/intervention-strategies/exercise-and-anti-aging"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"biomarkers-monitoring","title":"生物标志物与监测","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/longevity-medicine/biomarkers-monitoring","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"biological-age-assessment","title":"生物年龄评估方法：多维度衰老测量体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/longevity-medicine/biomarkers-monitoring/biological-age-assessment"},{"seq":2,"slug":"blood-biomarkers","title":"血液生物标志物：衰老追踪的分子窗口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/longevity-medicine/biomarkers-monitoring/blood-biomarkers"},{"seq":3,"slug":"wearable-health-monitoring","title":"可穿戴设备与健康监测：连续数据驱动的衰老追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/longevity-medicine/biomarkers-monitoring/wearable-health-monitoring"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"longevity-lifestyle","title":"长寿生活方式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/longevity-medicine/longevity-lifestyle","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"blue-zones-lifestyle","title":"蓝区长寿生活方式：百岁老人的自然实验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/longevity-medicine/longevity-lifestyle/blue-zones-lifestyle"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sleep-stress-social-longevity","title":"睡眠、压力与社交对寿命的影响","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/longevity-medicine/longevity-lifestyle/sleep-stress-social-longevity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"personal-longevity-strategy","title":"个人长寿策略设计：从知识到行动的系统框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/longevity-medicine/longevity-lifestyle/personal-longevity-strategy"}]}]}